-      (attachingBackwardMap_cell S hext a₁ a₀ H.symm)
-      (attachingBackwardMap_cell S hext a₀ a₁ H)
-    intro t a
-    simpa only [ContinuousMap.Homotopy.symm_symm] using
-      attachingDiskExtension_side S hext a₀ a₁ H t a
